// The look of the bunny follows the Bunny component the bunnyhopper systems write. It is a
// script of its own: a script does not react to changes of a component it sets itself, and
// world.flecs sets the Bunny of the player.

using bunnyhopper

player {
  BunnyModel: {speed: player[Bunny].speed, dead: player[Bunny].dead}
}
